            <div xml:id="d821">

                <pb facs="0715" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Stuart, J. Leighton: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-05">August 5,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received August 8—4:58 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 880. Ambassador having departed from China opening business August 2, I
                    assumed charge that time.</p>
                <p>Sent Department Cantel 880, repeated circular to Nanking and all Consulates
                    China.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
